{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teeny Tidy is an idle game where a little robot cleans your room whilst you work, focus, or relax. Customize the room with countless options, with different aspects of customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/8de9b176232ba46bacaae9fc21ff7520.poster.webp?t=1751062581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/8de9b176232ba46bacaae9fc21ff7520.webp?t=1751062581\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cleaning Buddy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your own cleaning robot</strong>. Whilst completing your day-to-day tasks, your robot friend Helps you clean your own little desktop room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/da40f58853778ae81a7057e2ea42b440.poster.webp?t=1751062581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/da40f58853778ae81a7057e2ea42b440.webp?t=1751062581\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Help Clean Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Give your robot a hand</strong>. You\u2019re more than welcome to give your little robot a hand with cleaning up, just click on different items in the room and take that workload away from your cleaning buddy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/9cdd9da2330f56ea56b0ef3c559dc037.poster.webp?t=1751062581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/9cdd9da2330f56ea56b0ef3c559dc037.webp?t=1751062581\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize your room!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create amazing rooms!</strong> The more you clean the more you earn, you can spend that coin on purchasing new furniture from the built in website and see what cool designs you can make!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/a6f5d3497b1376be80110c9978cd3061.poster.webp?t=1751062581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/a6f5d3497b1376be80110c9978cd3061.webp?t=1751062581\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839150?t=1751062581","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/6260fc7d42524ae28b10acc14a125b9c844d6314/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751062581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/1af4c0775ddc8dffa492c9d6353ec11e1a736108/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751062581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/1af4c0775ddc8dffa492c9d6353ec11e1a736108/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751062581","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teeny Tidy is an idle game where a little robot cleans your room whilst you work, focus, or relax. Customize the room with countless options, with different aspects of customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/8de9b176232ba46bacaae9fc21ff7520.poster.webp?t=1751062581\" medi